Problem
Create PR to merge story/fox-and-grapes into master, assign Tom as reviewer, review and merge as Tom.

Solution
Gitea UI Steps:

SSH as max to check repo:

bash
ssh max@<storage-server-ip>
cd ~/<repo>
git log --oneline --graph --decorate
git branch -r | grep story/fox-and-grapes
As max user:

Login to Gitea (max/Max_pass123)

Open repository

Pull Requests → New Pull Request

Source: story/fox-and-grapes → Target: master

Title: "Added fox-and-grapes story"

Create PR

Add reviewer: tom

As tom user:

Login to Gitea (tom/Tom_pass123)

Open PR → Review → Approve

Merge Pull Request
